00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:51,000
Everybody wanted to be in the Brat Pack. Except them.

2
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:36,000
BRATS is a documentary film directed by Andrew McCarthy.

3
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:21,000
In the 1980s, Andrew McCarthy was part of a young generation of actors who were set
to take over Hollywood after a string of successful teen movies.

4
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:06,000
However, when the New York magazine cover story in 1985 dubs them the Brat Pack, stars in the
making suddenly find themselves losing control over the trajectory of their careers.

5
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:51,000
Now, almost forty years later, McCarthy looks to reconnect with peers and co-stars
so that together they can reflect on their respective legacies.

6
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:36,000
Self, played by Andrew McCarthy.

