Self, played by Timothy Hutton.

12
01:09:00,000 --> 01:09:06,000
Brats is a 2024 documentary film, directed by Andrew McCarthy.

13
01:14:45,000 --> 01:14:51,000
It explores the Brat Pack, a group of young actors who frequently appeared together
in coming-of-age films, and the impact on their lives and careers.

14
01:20:30,000 --> 01:20:36,000
It had its world premiere at the Tribeca Festival on June 7,
2024, and was released on June 13, 2024, by Hulu.

15
01:26:15,000 --> 01:26:21,000
The film explores themes of teen movie, hollywood, 1980s.
